OL,3,CAfter Kabul: One man's journey from
OL,4,CTaliban rule to life in Britain
OL,6,FReporting by Caoimhe Willemoes
OL,8,FIt's a Saturday in Glasgow, and
OL,9,FElhan's phone is pinging with yet
OL,10,Fanother request.
OL,12,FToday is one of the busiest days of
OL,13,Fthe week for food delivery drivers,
OL,14,Fand the 42-year-old will work for
OL,15,Fabout 10 hours before he heads home.
OL,17,FHis life today is a far cry from what
OL,18,Fit was five years ago, when he lived
OL,19,Fwith his wife and his two young
OL,20,Fdaughters in Kabul and worked for the
OL,21,FBritish Embassy.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786652305
OL,3,CAfter Kabul: One man's journey from
OL,4,CTaliban rule to life in Britain
OL,6,FEarning a good salary, the Afghan
OL,7,Fnational was able to afford a big
OL,8,Fhouse and was admired by friends and
OL,9,Ffamily for working for a foreign
OL,10,Fgovernment.
OL,12,FHe was not able to disclose the
OL,13,Fdetails of his role, but said that it
OL,14,Fwas through his job that he started
OL,15,Fhearing about the gradual Taliban
OL,16,Ftakeover.
OL,18,F"The provinces were being taken over
OL,19,Fday by day, and we could see them come
OL,20,Fcloser," he told ITV News.
OL,26,@zD@AOU|D@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786652305
OL,3,CAfter Kabul: One man's journey from
OL,4,CTaliban rule to life in Britain
OL,6,FElhan said he knew his young family
OL,7,Fwould be in danger because he was
OL,8,Fworking for "the enemy", so he quickly
OL,9,Fstarted making arrangements to leave.
OL,11,FOn August 14, 2021, as the Taliban
OL,12,Fofficially closed in on Kabul, chaos
OL,13,Fbroke out at the international airport.
OL,15,FSome people started running alongside
OL,16,Fdeparting evacuation planes in a
OL,17,Fdesperate attempt to board them - it
OL,18,Fremains among the most striking images
OL,19,Fof the Taliban's return to power.
OL,26,@pD@MOUpD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786652305
OL,3,CAfter Kabul: One man's journey from
OL,4,CTaliban rule to life in Britain
OL,6,FThen, on August 26, a suicide bomb at
OL,7,Fthe main gate of the airport went off,
OL,8,Fkilling 169 Afghan civilians and 13
OL,9,Fmembers of the United States military.
OL,11,FElhan and his family were at the gate
OL,12,Fjust 15 minutes earlier, but were sent
OL,13,Faway after they were told by a Foreign
OL,14,FOffice official they would not be able
OL,15,Fto evacuate to the UK after all.
OL,17,F"When the blast happened, we were 150
OL,18,Fhundred and fifty meters away," he
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,26,@yD@AOUzD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786652305
OL,3,CAfter Kabul: One man's journey from
OL,4,CTaliban rule to life in Britain
OL,6,F"We saw people on the ground. My five-
OL,7,Fyear-old daughter asked me why a man
OL,8,Fwas on the floor. She asked: 'Is he
OL,9,Fsleeping? Why doesn't he have a proper
OL,10,Fpillow?'"
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FIn those two weeks, the UK evacuated
OL,18,Fmore than 15,000 people from
OL,19,FAfghanistan - but Elhan and his family
OL,20,Fwere not among them.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786652305
OL,3,CAfter Kabul: One man's journey from
OL,4,CTaliban rule to life in Britain
OL,6,FA bureaucratic error meant their names
OL,7,Fwere not on the list of evacuations
OL,8,Fgiven to the British embassy.
OL,10,FThey had to remain in the country for
OL,11,Fanother eight months, a period of time
OL,12,Fthat felt "very hard," Elhan recalled.
OL,14,F"I was constantly thinking about my
OL,15,Fwife and my daughters' futures," he
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,F"Fear was eating all of us, especially
OL,19,Ffor people who had worked with
OL,20,Fforeigners. Day by day it was getting
OL,21,Fworse."
OL,26,@tD@KOUtD@VO]vD@AOUwD@`O]}D@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786652305
OL,3,CAfter Kabul: One man's journey from
OL,4,CTaliban rule to life in Britain
OL,6,FOut of work, he spent this time
OL,7,Fphotographing everyday life under
OL,8,FTaliban rule.
OL,10,FPhotography was always a hobby, but
OL,11,Fafter a friend told him to sell his
OL,12,Fpictures, it became his lifeline and a
OL,13,Fmain source of income.
OL,15,F"I was photographing the streets, and
OL,16,Fwent on assignments to cover stories
OL,17,Fof Afghans struggling," he said.
OL,19,FThese times often felt tense, he said,
OL,20,Fand he was becoming more desperate to
OL,21,Fleave.
OL,26,@wD@AOUyD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786652305
OL,3,CAfter Kabul: One man's journey from
OL,4,CTaliban rule to life in Britain
OL,6,FHe recalled one moment in particular
OL,7,Fwhere he had been reprimanded by a
OL,8,FTaliban soldier for taking his sick
OL,9,Fwife to a doctor's appointment via a
OL,10,Fmain road rather than a quieter, more
OL,11,Fdiscreet route.
OL,13,F"Why are you flaunting your wife like
OL,14,Fthat?" the soldier had asked him. "Why
OL,15,Fare you holding her hand?"
OL,17,FElhan and his family became more
OL,18,Fisolated.
OL,26,@uD@AOUvD@FO]vD@cOUwD@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786652305
OL,3,CAfter Kabul: One man's journey from
OL,4,CTaliban rule to life in Britain
OL,6,FThen, a few months later, he was able
OL,7,Fto get his wife and children to a
OL,8,Fbordering country, where they
OL,9,Freapplied for asylum at the British
OL,10,Fembassy. A letter finally arrived that
OL,11,Fapproved their asylum application.
OL,13,FElhan still gets emotional when he
OL,14,Frecounts the taxi ride to the airport.
OL,15,FHe knew they had to go, but he also
OL,16,Ffelt like he left part of himself
OL,17,Fbehind in Afghanistan.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31110
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786652305
OL,3,CAfter Kabul: One man's journey from
OL,4,CTaliban rule to life in Britain
OL,6,F"We were happy, my kids, me, and my
OL,7,Fwife," he said. "It is where I was
OL,8,Fborn, where I lived, and in a moment,
OL,9,Feverything was gone. I started seeing
OL,10,FKabul differently."
OL,12,FA new life for the family
OL,14,FThe first few weeks in Scotland were
OL,15,Foverwhelming, and it was the first
OL,16,Ftime his family was exposed to racism,
OL,17,FElhan claimed.
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@FO]oD@QOUrD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31111
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786652305
OL,3,CAfter Kabul: One man's journey from
OL,4,CTaliban rule to life in Britain
OL,6,FWalking down the street, he would see
OL,7,Fanti-Muslim graffiti scrawled across
OL,8,Fwalls and buildings - he usually
OL,9,Fignores it, but said it was hard to at
OL,10,Ffirst.
OL,12,FUnwelcoming comments from some people
OL,13,Fat the beginning of his time in the UK
OL,14,F"made it harder to start a new life
OL,15,Fhere", he said. "I didn't dare to make
OL,16,Fnew friends."
OL,26,@xD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31112
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786652305
OL,3,CAfter Kabul: One man's journey from
OL,4,CTaliban rule to life in Britain
OL,6,FBut over the months, his children were
OL,7,Fenrolled in school and received
OL,8,Ftherapy to help with their trauma. His
OL,9,Fwife was also getting help, and with
OL,10,Ftime, she started to settle too. In
OL,11,FDecember 2025, she gave birth to twins.
OL,13,FHowever, as the family grew, one
OL,14,Foverarching concern was - and
OL,15,Fcontinues to be - a lack of work for
OL,16,FElhan, who said he has yet to get a
OL,17,Fwell-paid, stable job, despite his
OL,18,Frepeated efforts to apply.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31113
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786652305
OL,3,CAfter Kabul: One man's journey from
OL,4,CTaliban rule to life in Britain
OL,6,F"I have applied for a lot of jobs;
OL,7,Fthey like my CV, but we need to have
OL,8,Fsix months of work experience in the
OL,9,FUK. It keeps stopping me, even though
OL,10,Fwe have indefinite leave to remain."
OL,12,FFive years after the Taliban returned
OL,13,Fto power, the life Elhan once built in
OL,14,FKabul exists only in memories and
OL,15,Fphotographs.
OL,17,FWhile he continues delivering food
OL,18,Facross Glasgow and applying for jobs,
OL,19,Fhe hopes one day to return to the
OL,20,Fprofessional life he left behind.
OL,26,@rD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31114
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786652305
OL,3,CAfter Kabul: One man's journey from
OL,4,CTaliban rule to life in Britain
OL,6,FIn the meantime, he is focusing on the
OL,7,Ffuture, including plans to start a
OL,8,FYouTube channel and continue
OL,9,Fdocumenting the stories of Afghans
OL,10,Fwhose lives, like his own, were
OL,11,Fchanged forever by the events of
OL,12,FAugust 2021.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
